cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "AviationSafetyReportKnowledgeGraph: Code, Extracted Chains, Learned Networks and Judge Outputs"
abstract: >-
  Companion repository for "A Hybrid Framework for Explainable Aviation Risk:
  Causal Chain Extraction from Safety Reports with Physics-Based Failure
  Quantification and Interventional Analysis". It holds the extraction code,
  the causal chains extracted from 56,202 NTSB and FAA accident reports, the
  learned causal networks, the intervention tables, the judge outputs and the
  physics layer.
